 Mode! (Function supporting Game Center)】\nCompete with other players in Ranking Mode!\nAim for the most points in Score Attack, rush to clear stages the fastest in Time Race, and see who can finish the most stages in Endless.\nPolish your skills and aim for the top!\n\n5.【80 Challenges!! (Function supporting Game Center)】\n20 challenges in the Opening Stage of “STORY MODE” (*1)!!\nThere are 60 in following stages, so there are 80 challenges altogether!\n※(*1) does not supports Game Center.\n\n6.【Support Features to Help You Progress!】\nThose who don't know where to find the upgrades in-game, or who just want to power up right away, can easily get upgrades through the Customizations screen!\nThere are a range of support options, like Full Armor and All Weapons, to help you progress through the game smoother!\nTry discounted “Perfect Set” to be strongest!\nYou can also change the BGM to the arranged versions to give the game a different feel!\n\nNote: Support features and arranged BGM are paid content.\n\n------------\n\n◆Operating Methods\n\nMove・・・・・Direction button\nShot・・・Attack button\nJump・・・Jump button\nChange Weapon・・・Change Weapon button on the right top\n\nQuick Change・・・Try touching the top of the game screen! And scroll your finger right and left then let it go; you can change the weapon quick and easy!\nDismounting Ride Armor・・・Tap the icon on the right top\n\n------------\n\n[Important Notes]\nPlease see [Supported OS and Devices] in the lower part of the following link.\nhttps://www.capcom-games.com/product/en-us/megamanx-app/?t=openv\n\nNote: We cannot guarantee the app’s performance or offer refunds if you use a device not listed as compatible.", "trackCensoredName": "MEGA MAN X", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/mega-man-x/id469343097?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 3.57143, "sellerUrl": "https://www.capcom-games.com/product/en-us/megamanx-app/", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN", "FR", "JA", "ZH",